php -r "echo password_hash('your_secure_password', PASSWORD_DEFAULT);"
```

Copy the hash (starts with `$2y$10$...`), then insert:

```sql
INSERT INTO admins (username, password_hash) VALUES ('admin', 'paste_hash_here');
```

